HIRT, "THE NEPHEW" -- COMPLETE CHARACTER SHEET
High Concept: The Failed Daywalker. A living biological reactor built by
Valerius Caelus to test the limits of mortality. He is a man burning alive
from the inside, seeking the one thing that can cool his blood: the death
of his maker.
Role: Tank / Sustain / Damage Soak
Tier: Adept Companion (4 AP Equivalent)

Origin (see also oneshots/feast of fools line 441, oneshots/false flags):
a "Nephew of Cold Harbor" -- a vampire thrall/vampire lord hybrid Valerius
Caelus made through experiments in Falkreath. A failed experiment left to
fester. Joined the B-Team (Kyboh, Zach, Ava, Megan) after the Falkreath gala
massacre, then traveled with them north from Falkreath in "The False Flags."

============================================================
I. CORE MECHANICS
============================================================
Race: Nord (Modified)
Standing Stone: The Lady (+2 HP)

Stat Scores (Target Numbers):
Might: 16 (Hulking lumberjack strength, amplified by pain spasms)
Agility: 10 (Sluggish, weighted down by his own density)
Magic: 10 (Incapable of casting; uses blood-magic instinctively)
Guile: 4 (Shell-shocked and singular in purpose)

Resources:
Health Points (HP): 42 (Base) / Uncapped (Temporary HP Capacity)
