============================================================
V. ROLEPLAYING PROFILE
============================================================
Personality: The Broken Machine
Hirt is quiet, but not out of stoicism -- out of exhaustion. He is
constantly managing a low-level agony that would cripple a normal man. He
apologizes when he kills out of habit. "Sorry. Hungry. Sorry."

Core Motivation: Euthanasia via Homicide
He does not want to live forever. He wants to stop hurting. He believes the
only way to cure his condition is to kill the man who engineered it:
Valerius Caelus. He joins the party because they claim to have a possible
connection to his target and even better possible help.

Voice & Mannerisms:
  Voice: Ragged, breathy, like he has just finished running a mile.
  Tick: He scratches his arms constantly. His skin feels tight.
  Eating: He eats constantly -- raw meat, scraps, bones. Anything to keep
    the furnace fed without resorting to people (until the battle starts).

============================================================
VI. COMBAT TACTICS
============================================================
Role: The Ablative Meat Shield
Hirt is designed to be hit. He has low DR but a massive, replenishable
health pool.
  Opening: He charges the biggest threat to draw aggro.
  Sustain: He uses Bio-Siphon every other turn to keep his Temp HP high.
  Panic Button: If he takes a massive hit, he uses Mist Form to negate it
    and burn anyone close to him.
  The Bomb: If he is fully Overloaded (84+ Total HP), he fights recklessly,
    using his Fire damage bonus to shred armor.

